{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403870/extras/result_result_result_ScreenShot00095__3___3_.png?t=1744354534\" /><i><strong>An Action RPG set in a semi-open medieval world, created by Iron Forge Games.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403870/extras/result_HighresScreenshot00013__4_.png?t=1744354534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403870/extras/result_result_ScreenShot00095__3___2_.png?t=1744354534\" /><i><strong>Immerse yourself in a semi-open world with a dark and ruthless medieval atmosphere. From the intricate streets of towns to the depths of wild forests, a realistic world awaits you.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403870/extras/result_ScreenShot00158__3_.png?t=1744354534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403870/extras/result_result_ScreenShot00095__3___4_.png?t=1744354534\" /><strong><i>The people, unable to endure the tyranny and bloodshed of the monarchy, rise in rebellion. As the country nears the brink of civil war, the royal family flees the land. The army disbands, gangs flood the town, and chaos ensues. Innocent people are being killed, raped, and plundered. Someone must put an end to this savagery\u2026 And that is you. As you pursue justice and vengeance, you will be torn between being the people's hope and being dragged into the shadows of a dark past.  </i></strong><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403870/extras/result_ScreenShot00158__1_.png?t=1744354534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403870/extras/result_result_ScreenShot00095__3___5_.png?t=1744354534\" /><i><strong>Kill your enemies by hiding stealthily or face them in close combat! With dozens of weapon types, kill your enemies using the weapon of your choice and various techniques!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403870/extras/result_ScreenShot00158__2_.png?t=1744354534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403870/extras/result_result_ScreenShot00095__3___6_.png?t=1744354534\" /><i><strong>The townspeople bring the world to life with their daily routines. Interact with them, chat, trade, drink, pet animals, or watch street brawls.</strong></i><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403870/extras/result_ScreenShot00158__4_.png?t=1744354534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403870/extras/result_result_ScreenShot00095__3___7_.png?t=1744354534\" /><strong><i>Develop your character by increasing health, strength, and other attributes. Gain new skills to overcome the challenges ahead.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403870/extras/result_ScreenShot00158__3___1_.png?t=1744354534\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3403870?t=1744354534","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403870/42aa10552797ead8a1d1c030f37c871b4421aee8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1